### Products Listing 商品刊登接口测试

@temuAccessToken = replace-with-temu-access-token

### 查询商品分类
POST {{baseUrl}}/temu/products-listing/goods/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{"site":"US","accessToken":"{{temuAccessToken}}","parentCatId":0}

### 查询分类商品模板
POST {{baseUrl}}/temu/products-listing/goods/template
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{"site":"US","accessToken":"{{temuAccessToken}}","catId":4}

### 查询可用品牌与商标
POST {{baseUrl}}/temu/products-listing/goods/brand-trademarks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{"site":"US","accessToken":"{{temuAccessToken}}","brandId":4,"page":1,"size":25}

### 查询签名信息
POST {{baseUrl}}/temu/products-listing/goods/signature
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{"site":"US","accessToken":"{{temuAccessToken}}","brandId":4,"page":1,"size":25}

### 查询运费模板
POST {{baseUrl}}/temu/products-listing/shipping-templates
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{"site":"US","accessToken":"{{temuAccessToken}}"}

### 查询尺码元素
POST {{baseUrl}}/temu/products-listing/goods/size-elements
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{"site":"US","accessToken":"{{temuAccessToken}}","catId":4}

### 上传并自动处理商品图片
POST {{baseUrl}}/temu/products-listing/images/auto-transform
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{"site":"US","accessToken":"{{temuAccessToken}}","fileUrl":"https://example.com/image.jpg","formatConversionType":1,"scalingType":1,"compressionType":0}

### 创建规格 ID
POST {{baseUrl}}/temu/products-listing/specs
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{"site":"US","accessToken":"{{temuAccessToken}}","catId":4,"parentSpecId":1,"childSpecName":"spec name"}

### 创建商品
POST {{baseUrl}}/temu/products-listing/goods
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{"site":"US","accessToken":"{{temuAccessToken}}","goodsBasic":{"catId":30093,"goodsName":"Example goods"},"goodsDesc":"Example description","goodsProperty":{"goodsProperties":[]},"goodsServicePromise":{"costTemplateId":"LFT-example","fulfillmentType":1,"shipmentLimitDay":1},"goodsTrademark":{"brandId":110016314656,"trademarkId":211000162002},"skuList":[{"height":"1.0","length":"1.0","width":"1.0","weight":"1.0","weightUnit":"g","volumeUnit":"cm","images":["https://example.com/image.jpg"],"quantity":1,"specIdList":[]}]}

### 推荐商品分类
POST {{baseUrl}}/temu/products-listing/goods/category-recommendations
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{"site":"US","accessToken":"{{temuAccessToken}}","goodsName":"REX Commuter"}

### 推荐商品属性
POST {{baseUrl}}/temu/products-listing/goods/property-recommendations
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{"site":"US","accessToken":"{{temuAccessToken}}","catId":40023,"goodsName":"Dewalt DWD210G 120V Drill","goodsPropList":[{"propName":"color","values":["White"]}]}
